# Single targeted exception: this one checkpoint is required by
# scratchpad_historical_reproduction_guard.py REQUIRED_FILES, so the historical
# router qualification has a git-addressable reproduction point.
# NOTE: git will not descend into an excluded directory, so the models/ exclusion
# must be reopened for this path and then re-applied to everything except the file.
!flyff_farming_simulator/models/
flyff_farming_simulator/models/*
!flyff_farming_simulator/models/generalized_waypoint_both_seed2_0051200.zip
